GC2: 2 stacked G·C pairs (strand I reads CG; pairs C·G / G·C), 1EKA's GA/UC step repeated vibration circuit
* examples/rna_vibration. Units: C in u, L in Angstrom/mdyn; f_c [Hz] x 8185.679725 = wavenumber [1/cm].
